<newsitem itemid="101051" id="root" date="1996-10-07" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Cobham H1 pre-tax profits jump 47 percent.</title>
<headline>Cobham H1 pre-tax profits jump 47 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		15.7		   vs 12.39</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.50		   vs 3.05</p>
<p> Pretax		     20.8		   vs 14.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   132.0		  vs 111.4</p>
<p> Attributable	     14.0		   vs 9.5</p>
<p>NOTE - UK aeronautical components and systems supplier Cobham Plc said the second half has started well and order intake has grown substantially with total orders-in-hand currently in excess 400 million stg.  </p>
<p> Pay date		   Dec 12</p>
<p> Div registration date  Nov 12</p>
<p>--London newsroom - +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
